*.o
*.hpcstruct
# gpa-database holds regenerable pipeline output (gpa.advice, experiment.xml, src/,
# pipeline-logs/, profile-summary.json, pgo-ledger-index.json) alongside the two files
# that are NOT regenerable -- the ledger and baseline -- so ignore the directory's
# contents by default but explicitly keep those two.
# NOTE: needs the "**/" prefix, not just "gpa-database/*" -- a pattern with a
# non-trailing slash and no leading "**/" is anchored to this .gitignore's own
# directory (repo root) per gitignore's matching rules, so a bare
# "gpa-database/*" never matched any nested benchmark's gpa-database/ at all
# (e.g. rodinia/bfs/gpa-database/) -- found 2026-07-19 when onboarding xsbench,
# but it silently affected every existing benchmark too.
**/gpa-database/*
!**/gpa-database/pgo-ledger.md
!**/gpa-database/pgo-baseline.json
!**/gpa-database/pgo-baseline-output-*
gpa-measurements
gpa-database-*
gpa.log
